### 登录获取 token
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 添加学生 401
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODI0NjQyODIsImV4cCI6MTc4MjU1MDY4Mn0.ztGX3r-Mj9b1m_qiiA6M4bOATh1v-UwpP_torOyny4E

{
  "id": "401",
  "name": "批量删除测试1",
  "age": 20,
  "score": 88
}

